          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Types and typeof traps",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==7 primitives== (string, number, bigint, boolean, undefined, null, symbol): copied **by value**",
                "Objects, arrays, functions: **by reference**; `===` tests identity, so `{}==={}` is false",
                "`s[0]='X'` is ignored in sloppy mode, a TypeError in strict mode"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Value",
                "typeof",
                "Test with"
